<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net">
  <diagram name="System Design" id="system-design">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="1000" grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="3400" pageHeight="5200" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0"/>
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0"/>

        <mxCell id="title" value="Product Recommendation System" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;fontSize=26;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="1200" height="50" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="subtitle" value="Mock round — 2026-08-04 · candidate design above, optimal reference below" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;fontSize=13;fontColor=#808080;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="42" y="66" width="1200" height="26" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>

        <!-- ================= REQUIREMENTS ================= -->
        <mxCell id="fr_hdr" value="FUNCTIONAL REQUIREMENTS" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;fontSize=15;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1F4E79;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="120" width="600" height="30" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="fr_box" value="1.  Show related products for a product on the product page&#xa;&#xa;2.  Homepage — ranked list of recommended products for a signed-in user&#xa;     (refreshed as they browse)&#xa;&#xa;3.  Collect user activity events — views, clicks, add-to-cart, purchases,&#xa;     searches — to generate recommendations&#xa;&#xa;NOTE:  ranking itself is done by an ML model (abstracted);&#xa;the model is fed user data and product data" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=12;fillColor=#DEEBF7;strokeColor=#2E75B6;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="158" width="920" height="250" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="nfr_hdr" value="NON-FUNCTIONAL REQUIREMENTS" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;fontSize=15;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1F4E79;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1040" y="120" width="600" height="30" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="nfr_box" value="1.  Low-latency feed generation — p99 &lt; 200 ms&#xa;2.  Up to 3 min for recent events to affect the homepage&#xa;3.  Scale&#xa;      •  100M DAU,  10^5 s in a day&#xa;      •  10 views / user / day  →  10^9 events/day  →  ~10k events/s   (peak 10x)&#xa;      •  homepage 3x / user / day  →  ~3k homepage reads/s   (peak 10x)&#xa;      •  ~10k read req/s for similar-products (product page)&#xa;4.  Highly available — 99.9%      [ stated as 8.2 h/yr; actual 8.76 h/yr ]&#xa;5.  Eventual consistency acceptable for recommendations&#xa;&#xa;Out of scope:  never stated (asked twice)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=12;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#BF9000;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1040" y="158" width="1020" height="250" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>

        <!-- ================= ENTITIES / API ================= -->
        <mxCell id="ce_hdr" value="CORE ENTITIES" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;fontSize=15;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1F4E79;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="460" width="600" height="30" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ce_box" value="UserActivityEvent   ( userId, type, time, productId [optional], metadata.. )&#xa;&#xa;UserHomepageFeed  ( userId, products: [productId], updatedAt )&#xa;&#xa;SimilarProducts        ( productId, similarProducts: [productId], updatedAt )&#xa;&#xa;Product                     ( id, name, details.. )&#xa;&#xa;Feeds store product IDs only; bodies hydrated at read time&#xa;— explicitly framed as trading read latency for storage" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=12;fillColor=#E2EFDA;strokeColor=#548235;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="498" width="920" height="260" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="api_hdr" value="API DESIGN" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;fontSize=15;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1F4E79;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1040" y="460" width="600" height="30" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="api_box" value="NOTE:  identity extracted from JWT if needed&#xa;&#xa;GET   /products/:id/relatedProducts            (public, no auth)&#xa;         →  Product(id, name, title, price)[]&#xa;&#xa;GET   /recommendedProducts                       (identity from JWT; no :id in path)&#xa;         →  Product(id, name, title, price)[]&#xa;&#xa;POST  /userActivityEvents&#xa;         Request:  { type, productId, time, ip }&#xa;         Header:   Idempotency-Key      (de-dup on client retries)&#xa;         →  2xx, event accepted&#xa;&#xa;Pagination:  cursor-based (allows for dynamic insertions)&#xa;Anonymous traffic:  identified by request IP" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=12;fillColor=#FCE4D6;strokeColor=#C55A11;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1040" y="498" width="1020" height="300" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>

        <!-- ================= HIS HLD ================= -->
        <mxCell id="hld_sep" value="" style="line;strokeWidth=2;html=1;strokeColor=#1F4E79;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="870" width="3260" height="10" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="hld_hdr" value="HIGH-LEVEL DESIGN — as described" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;fontSize=18;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1F4E79;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="895" width="900" height="34" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="hld_note" value="incomplete — the round ended mid-HLD; only components he named are drawn" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;fontSize=12;fontColor=#808080;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="42" y="928" width="900" height="24" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="hl1" value="INGEST" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#C0C0C0;dashed=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=8;fontSize=12;fontColor=#909090;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="980" width="1560" height="230" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="h_client" value="Clients" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#D9D9D9;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="80" y="1050" width="160" height="90" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="h_api" value="POST /userActivityEvents&#xa;(ingest API)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#DEEBF7;strokeColor=#2E75B6;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="380" y="1045" width="280" height="100" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="h_kafka" value="Kafka&#xa;partitioned by sessionId&#xa;&#xa;[ late revision — replaced&#xa;querying Cassandra directly ]" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#BF9000;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="800" y="1030" width="300" height="130" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="h_cass" value="Cassandra — event store&#xa;partition:  sessionId + timeBucket&#xa;sort key:  eventTime&#xa;(WAL-append write throughput)" style="shape=cylinder3;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=16;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E2EFDA;strokeColor=#548235;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1240" y="1025" width="320" height="140" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="hl2" value="COMPUTE" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#C0C0C0;dashed=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=8;fontSize=12;fontColor=#909090;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="1300" width="1560" height="230" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="h_cron" value="Cron — every 3 min&#xa;schedules worker instances&#xa;(only users with activity&#xa;in the last 3 min)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FCE4D6;strokeColor=#C55A11;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="80" y="1360" width="280" height="120" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="h_worker" value="Worker instances&#xa;query events for the window,&#xa;build homepage feed" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FCE4D6;strokeColor=#C55A11;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="500" y="1360" width="280" height="120" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="h_ml" value="ML model&#xa;(abstracted)&#xa;fed user data + product data" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E1D5E7;strokeColor=#9673A6;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="920" y="1360" width="280" height="120" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="h_sql" value="SQL store&#xa;UserHomepageFeed&#xa;index on userId&#xa;( &quot;similar flow&quot; asserted&#xa;for SimilarProducts )" style="shape=cylinder3;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=16;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E2EFDA;strokeColor=#548235;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1300" y="1350" width="280" height="150" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="hl3" value="SERVE" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#C0C0C0;dashed=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=8;fontSize=12;fontColor=#909090;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="1620" width="1560" height="230" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="h_cdc" value="CDC&#xa;keeps Redis consistent when the&#xa;SQL homepage record is updated" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#BF9000;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1220" y="1680" width="300" height="120" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="h_redis" value="Redis cache&#xa;cache-aside + request coalescing&#xa;keeps the DB off the hot path at peak" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F8CECC;strokeColor=#B85450;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="700" y="1680" width="320" height="120" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="h_read" value="GET /recommendedProducts&#xa;GET /products/:id/relatedProducts" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#DEEBF7;strokeColor=#2E75B6;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="200" y="1680" width="320" height="120" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="he1" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="h_client" target="h_api"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="he1l" value="activity events" style="edgeLabel;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="he1"><mxGeometry x="-0.1" y="-12" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

        <mxCell id="he2" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="h_api" target="h_kafka"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="he2l" value="events" style="edgeLabel;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="he2"><mxGeometry x="-0.1" y="-12" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

        <mxCell id="he3" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="h_kafka" target="h_cass"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="he3l" value="events (original path: API → Cassandra directly)" style="edgeLabel;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="he3"><mxGeometry x="-0.05" y="-14" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

        <mxCell id="he4" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;strokeColor=#B85450;" edge="1" parent="1" source="h_cass" target="h_worker">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1400" y="1250"/><mxPoint x="640" y="1250"/></Array></mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="he4l" value="query events for last 3 min — scatter-gather over every partition (abandoned)" style="edgeLabel;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;fontColor=#B85450;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="he4"><mxGeometry x="0" y="-12" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

        <mxCell id="he5" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="h_cron" target="h_worker"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="he5l" value="schedules" style="edgeLabel;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="he5"><mxGeometry x="-0.1" y="-12" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

        <mxCell id="he6" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="h_worker" target="h_ml"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="he6l" value="user + product data" style="edgeLabel;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="he6"><mxGeometry x="-0.1" y="-12" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

        <mxCell id="he7" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="h_ml" target="h_sql"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="he7l" value="ranked list → feed written" style="edgeLabel;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="he7"><mxGeometry x="-0.05" y="-12" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

        <mxCell id="he8" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="h_sql" target="h_cdc"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="he8l" value="row change" style="edgeLabel;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="he8"><mxGeometry x="0" y="-14" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

        <mxCell id="he9" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="h_cdc" target="h_redis"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="he9l" value="keeps cache consistent" style="edgeLabel;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="he9"><mxGeometry x="0" y="-12" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

        <mxCell id="he10" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="h_read" target="h_redis"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="he10l" value="read (cache-aside + coalescing)" style="edgeLabel;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="he10"><mxGeometry x="0" y="-12" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

        <mxCell id="he11" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="h_redis" target="h_sql">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="860" y="1880"/><mxPoint x="1660" y="1880"/><mxPoint x="1660" y="1470"/></Array></mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="he11l" value="miss → fetch feed" style="edgeLabel;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="he11"><mxGeometry x="0" y="-12" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

        <mxCell id="h_gap" value="NOT SPECIFIED WHEN THE ROUND ENDED&#xa;&#xa;•  what consumes the Kafka topics, and what Cassandra is still for once Kafka exists&#xa;&#xa;•  how SimilarProducts is actually computed — co-view pair counting was never designed&#xa;&#xa;•  active users per 3-min window  →  model invocations/s  →  SQL write rate  →  Redis invalidation rate&#xa;    (asked four times, never produced)&#xa;&#xa;•  product hydration path — feeds store IDs only, so something must resolve them&#xa;&#xa;•  monitoring, cost, DLQ / backpressure, consumer lag, cold start, fallback when cache + DB are both down" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=12;fillColor=#F2F2F2;strokeColor=#A6A6A6;dashed=1;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1700" y="1030" width="1200" height="300" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>

        <!-- ================= OPTIMAL ================= -->
        <mxCell id="opt_sep" value="" style="line;strokeWidth=4;html=1;strokeColor=#7030A0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="1960" width="3260" height="10" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="opt_hdr" value="OPTIMAL REFERENCE — what a senior strong-hire would design" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;fontSize=22;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#7030A0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="1990" width="1600" height="40" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="o_ce_hdr" value="1 · CORE ENTITIES" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;fontSize=15;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#7030A0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="2060" width="600" height="30" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o_ce" value="ActivityEvent      ( eventId [uuid — dedup], userId | null, sessionId, deviceId, productId,&#xa;                              type ∈ {view, click, add_to_cart, purchase, search}, ts, source,&#xa;                              context { page, position } )&#xa;&#xa;Session                 ( sessionId, userId | null, deviceId, startedAt, lastSeenAt, country )&#xa;&#xa;Product                  ( productId, title, imageUrl, price, currency, categoryId, brandId,&#xa;                              inStock, isActive, embedding[] )&#xa;                              ↳ owned by the Catalog service, replicated read-only&#xa;&#xa;UserProfile           ( userId, recentProductIds[50], categoryAffinity{}, embedding[], updatedAt )&#xa;&#xa;ItemSimilarity      ( productId, [ { productId, score, reason } ] top-100, computedAt, version )&#xa;&#xa;UserFeed               ( userId, [ { productId, score, sourceCandidate } ] top-500,&#xa;                              modelVersion, generatedAt, expiresAt )&#xa;&#xa;CoViewCount      ( productA, productB, count, windowStart )     ↳ intermediate aggregation state" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=12;fillColor=#E1D5E7;strokeColor=#9673A6;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="2098" width="1300" height="420" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="o_api_hdr" value="2 · API DESIGN" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;fontSize=15;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#7030A0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1420" y="2060" width="600" height="30" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o_api" value="POST  /v1/events                                             batched, fire-and-forget from the client&#xa;    Headers:  Idempotency-Key: &lt;eventId&gt;&#xa;    Body:      { events: [ { eventId, sessionId, deviceId, productId, type, ts, context } ] }&#xa;    →  202 Accepted  { accepted: n, rejected: [ { eventId, reason } ] }&#xa;    userId is derived from the JWT server-side, NEVER from the body — the body is spoofable.&#xa;    Anonymous identity = sessionId cookie + deviceId.  NOT the IP address.&#xa;&#xa;GET   /v1/products/{productId}/similar ? limit=20 &amp; cursor=&lt;opaque&gt; &amp; context=pdp&#xa;    →  200  { items: [ { productId, title, imageUrl, price, currency, inStock, score } ],&#xa;                    nextCursor, generatedAt, modelVersion }&#xa;    Cache-Control: public, max-age=300        ← CDN-cacheable: it is not personalized&#xa;&#xa;GET   /v1/recommendations ? limit=20 &amp; cursor=&lt;opaque&gt; &amp; surface=homepage&#xa;    Auth:  JWT — identity from the token, no userId in the path, so no IDOR surface&#xa;    →  200  { items: [ { productId, title, imageUrl, price, currency, inStock, score } ],&#xa;                    nextCursor, generatedAt, isFallback, modelVersion }&#xa;    Cursor is an opaque { feedVersion, offset } so paging stays stable across regeneration.&#xa;    Cache-Control: private, no-store&#xa;&#xa;GET   /v1/recommendations/health/staleness         internal — feed-age percentiles&#xa;&#xa;Errors:  400 invalid · 401 no token · 429 + Retry-After · 503 + fallback payload" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=12;fillColor=#FCE4D6;strokeColor=#C55A11;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1420" y="2098" width="1480" height="480" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="o_hld_hdr" value="3 · HIGH-LEVEL DESIGN" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;fontSize=15;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#7030A0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="2640" width="600" height="30" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>

        <!-- lane 1: ingest -->
        <mxCell id="ol1" value="INGEST" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#C0C0C0;dashed=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=8;fontSize=12;fontColor=#909090;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="2690" width="2860" height="400" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o_client" value="Clients&#xa;web / app" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#D9D9D9;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="90" y="2770" width="180" height="100" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o_ingest" value="Event Ingest Service&#xa;validate · enrich · dedup&#xa;stateless, autoscaled" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#DEEBF7;strokeColor=#2E75B6;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="400" y="2760" width="320" height="120" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o_dedup" value="Redis — dedup set&#xa;SET eventId NX EX 1h&#xa;best-effort only; the real&#xa;guarantee is idempotent consumers" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F8CECC;strokeColor=#B85450;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="400" y="2940" width="320" height="120" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o_kafka" value="Kafka   topic: activity-events&#xa;key = sessionId  → co-view locality&#xa;~100k msg/s peak · 7d retention&#xa;replication 3 · DLQ topic" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#BF9000;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="850" y="2755" width="360" height="130" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o_archive" value="S3 / Cassandra&#xa;raw event archive&#xa;offline training · replay" style="shape=cylinder3;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=16;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E2EFDA;strokeColor=#548235;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1340" y="2750" width="320" height="140" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o_ingest_note" value="Why a log and not the event DB&#xa;&#xa;&quot;all events in the last 3 minutes&quot; has no partition key,&#xa;so a cron over Cassandra degenerates into a&#xa;scatter-gather across every partition.&#xa;&#xa;Kafka gives an ordered, offset-addressable,&#xa;replayable stream — the archive is for training&#xa;and replay, never for the serving pipeline." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=12;fillColor=#F2F2F2;strokeColor=#A6A6A6;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1780" y="2750" width="620" height="200" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="ope1" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="o_client" target="o_ingest"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ope1l" value="POST /v1/events" style="edgeLabel;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="ope1"><mxGeometry x="-0.1" y="-12" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ope1b" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="o_ingest" target="o_dedup"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ope1bl" value="seen before?" style="edgeLabel;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="ope1b"><mxGeometry x="0" y="-14" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ope2" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="o_ingest" target="o_kafka"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ope2l" value="produce, key = sessionId" style="edgeLabel;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="ope2"><mxGeometry x="-0.05" y="-12" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ope3" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="o_kafka" target="o_archive"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ope3l" value="sink connector" style="edgeLabel;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="ope3"><mxGeometry x="-0.05" y="-12" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

        <!-- lane 2: compute -->
        <mxCell id="ol2" value="COMPUTE — TWO PLANES" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#C0C0C0;dashed=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=8;fontSize=12;fontColor=#909090;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="3180" width="2860" height="560" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o_flink" value="NEARLINE  ·  Flink / Kafka Streams&#xa;&#xa;•  sessionize by sessionId (30-min gap)&#xa;•  emit co-viewed pairs (A,B) per session&#xa;•  maintain per-user recent-activity vector&#xa;•  mark a user DIRTY on activity&#xa;&#xa;→ this is what meets the 3-min SLA" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=12;fillColor=#FCE4D6;strokeColor=#C55A11;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="90" y="3260" width="420" height="200" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o_batch" value="OFFLINE  ·  Spark, every 1–6 h&#xa;&#xa;•  item-item co-view / co-purchase matrix&#xa;•  normalise by lift / PMI, not raw counts&#xa;•  product + user embeddings&#xa;&#xa;→ writes ItemSimilarity, refreshes ANN index" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=12;fillColor=#FCE4D6;strokeColor=#C55A11;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="90" y="3500" width="420" height="200" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o_candgen" value="Candidate Generation&#xa;only for DIRTY users&#xa;&#xa;•  ANN over the user embedding (top 500)&#xa;•  ∪ ItemSimilarity of last-viewed items&#xa;•  ∪ trending in affinity categories&#xa;&#xa;→ ~1–2k candidates, no model yet" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=12;fillColor=#E1D5E7;strokeColor=#9673A6;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="620" y="3260" width="420" height="200" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o_rank" value="Ranking Service&#xa;ML model (abstracted)&#xa;&#xa;scores ~1–2k candidates,&#xa;keeps the top 500&#xa;batched GPU inference&#xa;&#xa;~1k inferences/s · 10k at peak" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=12;fillColor=#E1D5E7;strokeColor=#9673A6;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1150" y="3260" width="420" height="200" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o_fstore" value="Feature Store&#xa;online features for ranking&#xa;(user vector, item stats)" style="shape=cylinder3;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=16;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E2EFDA;strokeColor=#548235;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="660" y="3520" width="340" height="160" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o_ann" value="ANN / Vector Index&#xa;product embeddings" style="shape=cylinder3;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=16;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E2EFDA;strokeColor=#548235;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1190" y="3520" width="340" height="160" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o_sizing" value="THE NUMBER THAT DECIDES THIS LANE&#xa;&#xa;Users active in any 3-min window&#xa;    = 100M × 180 / 10^5  ≈  180k&#xa;&#xa;Dirty-only regeneration&#xa;    = 180k / 180 s  ≈  1k inferences/s   ( 10k at peak )&#xa;&#xa;Regenerating ALL users every 3 min&#xa;    = 100M / 180 s  ≈  550k inferences/s&#xa;&#xa;→ a 500x difference. That ratio is the argument&#xa;    for dirty-only, and it is why the naive&#xa;    &quot;cron rebuilds every feed&quot; design cannot ship.&#xa;&#xa;Stale-for-other-reasons users (price drop, restock)&#xa;are caught by TTL + a nightly full refresh." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=12;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#BF9000;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1700" y="3260" width="700" height="420" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="ope4" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;exitX=0.25;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.25;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="o_kafka" target="o_flink">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="940" y="3130"/><mxPoint x="195" y="3130"/></Array></mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ope4l" value="consume" style="edgeLabel;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="ope4"><mxGeometry x="0" y="-12" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

        <mxCell id="ope5" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="o_archive" target="o_batch">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1500" y="3160"/><mxPoint x="65" y="3160"/><mxPoint x="65" y="3600"/></Array></mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ope5l" value="hourly / daily batch" style="edgeLabel;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="ope5"><mxGeometry x="0.2" y="-12" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

        <mxCell id="ope6" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="o_flink" target="o_candgen"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ope6l" value="dirty userIds + recent vector" style="edgeLabel;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="ope6"><mxGeometry x="0" y="-12" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

        <mxCell id="ope7" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="o_candgen" target="o_rank"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ope7l" value="~1–2k candidates" style="edgeLabel;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="ope7"><mxGeometry x="0" y="-12" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

        <mxCell id="ope8" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="o_candgen" target="o_fstore"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ope8l" value="features" style="edgeLabel;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="ope8"><mxGeometry x="0" y="-14" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

        <mxCell id="ope9" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="o_rank" target="o_ann"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ope9l" value="embeddings" style="edgeLabel;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="ope9"><mxGeometry x="0" y="-14" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

        <mxCell id="ope10" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="o_batch" target="o_fstore"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ope10l" value="ItemSimilarity + embeddings" style="edgeLabel;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="ope10"><mxGeometry x="0" y="-12" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

        <!-- lane 3: serve -->
        <mxCell id="ol3" value="SERVE — read path, p99 budget 200 ms" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#C0C0C0;dashed=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=8;fontSize=12;fontColor=#909090;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="3830" width="2860" height="480" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o_reader" value="Clients&#xa;(read)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#D9D9D9;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="90" y="3930" width="170" height="110" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o_gw" value="API Gateway / CDN&#xa;&#xa;CDN caches /similar (public)&#xa;never caches /recommendations" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#D9D9D9;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="370" y="3910" width="340" height="150" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o_recsvc" value="Recommendation Service&#xa;&#xa;1. cache  →  2. KV store  →  3. FALLBACK&#xa;light re-rank with in-session events&#xa;filters: out-of-stock, already purchased, dedupe" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#DEEBF7;strokeColor=#2E75B6;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="820" y="3910" width="420" height="150" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o_redis" value="Redis Cluster&#xa;feed + similarity cache&#xa;write-through on generation&#xa;request coalescing (single-flight)&#xa;hot-key replication  key#0..N" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F8CECC;strokeColor=#B85450;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1350" y="3905" width="360" height="160" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o_feedkv" value="UserFeed — KV store&#xa;DynamoDB / Cassandra&#xa;pk = userId · top-500 IDs + scores&#xa;~100M rows · ~200 GB · TTL 24 h" style="shape=cylinder3;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=16;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E2EFDA;strokeColor=#548235;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1820" y="3895" width="360" height="180" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o_simkv" value="ItemSimilarity — KV store&#xa;pk = productId · top-100 + scores&#xa;~50M products · ~40 GB&#xa;not personalized → fully cacheable" style="shape=cylinder3;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=16;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E2EFDA;strokeColor=#548235;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2280" y="3895" width="360" height="180" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o_hydrate" value="Product Hydration&#xa;multi-get from the Catalog cache&#xa;title · image · price · stock&#xa;— the reason feeds store IDs only" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#DEEBF7;strokeColor=#2E75B6;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="820" y="4130" width="420" height="140" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o_fallback" value="Fallback&#xa;trending / popular-in-category&#xa;response carries isFallback = true" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#BF9000;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1350" y="4130" width="360" height="140" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="ope11" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="o_reader" target="o_gw"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ope11l" value="GET /v1/…" style="edgeLabel;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="ope11"><mxGeometry x="-0.1" y="-12" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ope12" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="o_gw" target="o_recsvc"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ope12l" value="CDN miss only" style="edgeLabel;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="ope12"><mxGeometry x="-0.05" y="-12" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ope13" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="o_recsvc" target="o_redis"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ope13l" value="1 · feed IDs  (~1 ms)" style="edgeLabel;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="ope13"><mxGeometry x="-0.05" y="-12" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ope14" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="o_redis" target="o_feedkv"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ope14l" value="2 · miss → KV" style="edgeLabel;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="ope14"><mxGeometry x="-0.05" y="-12" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ope15" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="o_feedkv" target="o_simkv"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ope16" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="o_recsvc" target="o_hydrate"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ope16l" value="20 IDs → multi-get" style="edgeLabel;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="ope16"><mxGeometry x="0" y="-14" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ope17" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;strokeColor=#BF9000;" edge="1" parent="1" source="o_hydrate" target="o_fallback"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ope17l" value="3 · nothing found / store down" style="edgeLabel;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="ope17"><mxGeometry x="0" y="-12" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

        <mxCell id="ope18" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#7030A0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="o_rank" target="o_feedkv">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1360" y="3770"/><mxPoint x="2000" y="3770"/></Array></mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ope18l" value="write top-500 UserFeed (write-through to cache)" style="edgeLabel;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;fontColor=#7030A0;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="ope18"><mxGeometry x="0" y="-12" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

        <mxCell id="ope19" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.75;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#7030A0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="o_batch" target="o_simkv">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="2460" y="3650"/></Array></mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ope19l" value="write ItemSimilarity" style="edgeLabel;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;fontColor=#7030A0;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="ope19"><mxGeometry x="0.4" y="-12" relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

        <!-- ================= TRADE-OFFS ================= -->
        <mxCell id="o_to_hdr" value="4 · KEY TRADE-OFFS   (each against a NAMED alternative)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;fontSize=15;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#7030A0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="4380" width="900" height="30" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o_to" value="Kafka as the pipeline backbone   vs   a cron querying the event DB&#xa;      A database is not a stream. &quot;All events in the last 3 min&quot; has no partition key, so it degenerates to a&#xa;      scatter-gather over every partition. Kafka gives an ordered, offset-addressable, replayable log.&#xa;      GIVING UP:  an extra system, and at-least-once delivery the consumer must make idempotent.&#xa;&#xa;Key events by sessionId   vs   by userId&#xa;      Co-view pairs are a within-session, cross-user signal. Keying by userId puts the two halves of a pair&#xa;      on different partitions.   GIVING UP:  per-user aggregation now needs a shuffle or a second keyed stream.&#xa;&#xa;Regenerate only DIRTY users   vs   regenerate all 100M every 3 min&#xa;      550k inferences/s versus ~1k. Most users are not online, so most of that work is discarded.&#xa;      GIVING UP:  a user whose drivers changed for other reasons (price drop, restock) goes stale —&#xa;      handled by TTL plus a nightly refresh.&#xa;&#xa;Two-stage candidate generation → ranking   vs   ranking the whole catalog&#xa;      You cannot score 50M products per request. Cheap recall narrows to ~1–2k, then the expensive model ranks.&#xa;      GIVING UP:  anything recall misses can never be recommended.&#xa;&#xa;Precompute feeds   vs   compute on read&#xa;      p99 200 ms cannot contain candidate generation plus inference. Precompute top-500, re-rank top-20 cheaply&#xa;      at read time.   GIVING UP:  ~200 GB of feed storage for users who may never log in — TTL it.&#xa;&#xa;KV store for feeds   vs   SQL with an index on userId&#xa;      Access is a single-key lookup of a blob. No joins, no transactions, no range scans. SQL adds a planner,&#xa;      connection limits and a scaling ceiling for nothing.   GIVING UP:  ad-hoc querying of feeds.&#xa;&#xa;Write-through on generation   vs   cache-aside with CDC invalidation&#xa;      The feed generator is the ONLY writer, so it can populate the cache directly — no CDC pipeline, no&#xa;      invalidate-then-read race.   GIVING UP:  cache writes on the generation path.&#xa;      (Cache-aside plus coalescing remains right for the long tail.)&#xa;&#xa;Session cookie + deviceId for anonymous   vs   IP address&#xa;      CGNAT collapses thousands of unrelated users behind one IP, and mobile IPs change mid-session — so IP&#xa;      both merges strangers' co-views and splits one person's session.   GIVING UP:  cookie loss = lost identity." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=16;spacingTop=14;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#BF9000;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="4418" width="1560" height="700" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>

        <!-- ================= DEEP DIVES ================= -->
        <mxCell id="o_dd_hdr" value="5 · DEEP DIVES" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;fontSize=15;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#7030A0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1700" y="4380" width="900" height="30" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o_dd" value="THE CORE HARD PROBLEM — co-view at 100k events/s&#xa;      Flink sessionizes by sessionId (30-min gap) and emits pairs (A,B) co-viewed in a session.&#xa;      A session of k views yields k² pairs — cap k at the last ~20 or a crawler-like session blows up the job.&#xa;      Aggregate in a sliding window, then NORMALISE: raw counts just re-rank the catalog by popularity.&#xa;      Use lift / PMI  —  count(A,B) / ( count(A)·count(B) )  —  or &quot;phone case&quot; recommends &quot;iPhone&quot; to everyone.&#xa;&#xa;WHERE IT BREAKS AT SCALE&#xa;      Break 1 — full feed regeneration:  550k inferences/s.  Fix: dirty-only + TTL → ~1k/s, 10k/s at peak.&#xa;      Break 2 — cron over Cassandra:  scatter-gather over every partition per window.  Fix: Kafka log.&#xa;      Break 3 — co-view pair explosion:  cap session length; count-min sketch for the tail, exact for the head.&#xa;      Break 4 — 10x read peak (30k homepage + 100k pdp /s):  CDN the /similar endpoint — it is public and&#xa;                          not personalized, so most pdp load never reaches the service at all.&#xa;&#xa;HOT KEYS / HOT PARTITIONS&#xa;      A viral product's ItemSimilarity key is read by every visitor on that page. Redis: replicate as&#xa;      key#0..key#N and pick at random, plus a short-TTL in-process local cache in the service.&#xa;      Kafka: a bot session hot-spots one partition — cap per-session throughput at ingest.&#xa;&#xa;CONSISTENCY &amp; IDEMPOTENCY&#xa;      Kafka is at-least-once, so co-view counts double-count on replay. Dedup by eventId inside the window&#xa;      state, or write absolute aggregates rather than increments so replay is harmless.&#xa;      The ingest-side Redis dedup is best-effort only — it is not in a transaction with the produce.&#xa;      Feeds are eventually consistent by design, but pagination must be stable: the cursor pins feedVersion&#xa;      so a regeneration mid-scroll does not reshuffle page 2.&#xa;&#xa;OPERABILITY — how you know it is stale or wrong&#xa;      •  Feed staleness histogram:  now − generatedAt, p50/p99.  Alert when p99 &gt; 3 min — that IS the SLA.&#xa;      •  Kafka consumer lag per partition — the leading indicator; staleness is the lagging one.&#xa;      •  Coverage: % of DAU with a fresh feed.  Fallback rate: % of responses with isFallback = true.&#xa;      •  Empty/short-response rate, out-of-stock leakage, CTR as a guardrail against a bad model version.&#xa;      •  modelVersion pinned per feed row, so a bad rollout is attributable and revertible.&#xa;&#xa;FAILURE MODES&#xa;      Redis down → KV store (slower, survivable).   KV down → trending fallback, isFallback = true.&#xa;      Flink down → feeds stale but still served; alert on staleness, replay from Kafka offsets on recovery.&#xa;      Ranking service down → serve the previous feed. It is a recommendation, not a payment.&#xa;&#xa;COLD START&#xa;      New user: popular-in-category + geo trending; personalise after the first few events.&#xa;      New product: content-based similarity from title / category / embedding until co-view data accrues." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=16;spacingTop=14;fillColor=#F8CECC;strokeColor=#B85450;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1700" y="4418" width="1560" height="700" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>

      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
